<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 9.</p>
<p>				    May 09/May 08   May 09/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.11		 5.89</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.05		 4.57</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.01		 8.03</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.57		48.88</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.37		30.59</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.38		31.58</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.06		 6.88</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.42		16.58</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.49		36.46</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.44		35.84</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.03		12.67</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.03		69.80</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,169,715,851,621</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,880,812,072,135</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,012,019,690,249</p>
<p>  International funds			    88,571,164,085</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    208,312,925,152</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
